notes.content:
[h3]Whats new in Update 1.0.4.0[/h3]

- Added 38 Steam achievements - destroy enemies, accumulate money, collect food, gain reputation, explore locations, install upgrades and much more;
- Improved AI of game units (especially the "infected" - now it's going to be hot with them);

- Added items and notes in some locations;
- Fixed player inertia in some situations;
- Fixed the highlighting of enemy units in tactical scanner view in some situations;

- Changed the volume of some sound effects;
- Changed the balance of cost of game items;
- Changed the balance of game items generation;
- Reduced the cost of crafting some items;
- Missiles fired by androids no longer explode when they hit Corporation units;

- Many other changes and fixes.
